The "Interesting" Part - What Makes Polonium Special
1. Conversational Code Understanding
Instead of just answering questions, the AI builds a mental model of the codebase as you discuss it. Every conversation teaches the AI something new about the repository.

2. Collective Intelligence
When 100 developers ask questions about the same repo, the AI learns from all of them. The 101st developer benefits from everyone who came before.

3. Living Documentation
The chat history becomes executable documentation. You can replay conversations, see how understanding evolved, and extract decisions made.

4. Code Archeology
Track why decisions were made, what alternatives were considered, and how understanding changed over time. Not just git blame for code, but git blame for knowledge.
